{
    "Description": {
        "Id": "forceevent_co_Jarl",
        "Name": "The Goat and the Lutefisk",
        "Details": "You are halfway through reviewing the after-action report from the last rescue mission when Darius interrupts you, accompanied by the man you rescued.\r\n\r\nThe man looks like he stepped directly out of one of those antiquated Terran holovids about wizards and enchanted kingdoms. Flowing robes, an elaborate hat, and a long staff complete the appearance, making you wonder if the rescue team accidentally brought back the wrong person.\r\n\r\n\"Commander,\" Darius begins, \"our guest wanted to personally thank you for rescuing him from his captors. Apparently, they were rather interested in his… culinary expertise?\"\r\n\r\nThe wizard-like man smiles warmly.\r\n\r\n\"Actually, my recipe, Commander. A unique preparation involving lutefisk and goat's milk and... well, that's a trade secret. They wanted it badly enough to kidnap me.\"\r\n\r\nDarius looks puzzled.\r\n\r\n\"Commander, we happen to have a goat and an entire crate of lutefisk in the cargo hold. I've spent the a lot of time pondering how those two things possibly combine, and I admit I'm coming up empty.\"\r\n\r\nThe man's eyes suddenly widen.\r\n\r\n\"You have both?\"\r\n\r\nYou nod cautiously.\r\n\r\nHe straightens, his expression becoming almost conspiratorial.\r\n\r\n\"Then perhaps I can repay you properly. Give me the goat and the lutefisk, and I will introduce you to a legendary MechWarrior looking for employment.\"\r\n\r\nDarius stares at him.\r\n\r\n\"You're trading a goat and some fish for a MechWarrior?\"\r\n\r\nThe man smiles.\r\n\r\n\"Not just any MechWarrior.\"\r\n",
        "Icon": "uixTxrSpot_JarlWizard.png"
    },
