                {
                    "Description": {
                        "Id": "outcome_0_0",
                        "Name": "The Argo is not a Halfway House",
                        "Details": "You shake your head politely. \"I appreciate the offer, but this isn't a halfway house. I'm not hiring an unknown MechWarrior simply because you call them legendary. I have no idea what they can actually do, or even their skill, and I'm not trading a goat and a crate of lutefisk to find out.\"\r\n\r\nThe chemist's smile fades slightly. \"A pity, Commander. You may never know what you turned down.\""
