                        "Id": "outcome_1_0",
                        "Name": "No Spare Room",
                        "Details": "You shake your head.\r\n\r\n\"I'd like to help, but we're already at capacity. The barracks are full, and I don't have a berth for another MechWarrior.\"\r\n\r\nThe chemist nods reluctantly. \"A practical limitation. Perhaps another time, Commander.\"\r\n\r\nDarius gives you an approving nod. \"At least we won't have to explain to Yang why we're squeezing another pilot into the barracks.\""
