                        "Name": "Fire [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] for more room",
                        "Details": "You consider the offer for a moment before turning toward Darius.  \"We can make room.\"\r\n\r\nDarius raises an eyebrow. \"Commander?\"\r\n\r\nYou scroll briefly through your datapad and point at one entry: [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]]. \"We'll terminate [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]]'s contract and make the space available.\"\r\n\r\nThe chemist smiles. \"Then I believe we have a deal.\"\r\n\r\nDarius looks less convinced. \"You're really firing a MechWarrior to make room for someone we've never met?\"\r\n\r\nYou look back at the strange man in wizard's robes. \"Apparently.\"\r\n\r\nThe chemist simply smiles. \"You won't regret it.\"\r\n\r\n<color=#f69c24>Jarl Jarlson is now in your barracks</color>"
                    },
