                    "Description": {
                        "Id": "outcome_3_0",
                        "Name": "Let's Do This!",
                        "Details": "You look from the chemist to Darius, then back again. \"All right. We have a deal. The goat and the lutefisk are yours. Bring me this legendary MechWarrior.\"\r\n\r\nThe chemist's face breaks into a broad grin. \"Excellent! You won't regret this.\"\r\n\r\nA short time later, you meet Jarl Jarlson, an enigmatic JàrnFòlk MechWarrior whose origins are shrouded in unanswered questions and whose resemblance to the missing Carl Marik has earned him an unfortunate reputation for making questions disappear along with the people asking them.\r\n\r\nWhatever his origins, Jarl is an exceptionally effective battlefield commander, best known for his unconventional mastery of mortar launchers. His infamous tactic of loading them with lutefisk allows him to blind enemy cockpits and sensors while sowing confusion across the battlefield, earning him a reputation as one of the JàrnFòlk's most unconventional and effective warriors.\r\n\r\nYou look toward Darius. \"Remind me to never ask what was actually in that lutefisk.\"\r\n\r\n<color=#f69c24>Jarl Jarlson is now in your barracks</color>"
                    },
